<tabber>Japanese Patch Notes=
==Miscellaneous==
*Changed the name '''Manga Daragogogo Cat''' to '''[[Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat (Switch Special Cat)|Manga Darabotchgogogo Cat]]'''
*Added the mission "Update the app to Ver1.0.8!" which awards the user 10 [[Cat Capsule|Rare Tickets]] once clearing [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]] from the [[Empire of Cats]].
*Fixed text issue in which all Advent Stages did not state what was needed for it to be required. Now says "Clear Floor 10 of The Heavenly Tower to take on this challenge!" When attempting to enter stage without meeting said requirement.

==Removed==
*Removed the mission "Update the app to Ver.1.0.7!"

