===Miscellaneous===
*The [[Heavenly Tower]] is now distributed, can be unlocked once clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] in the [[Empire of Cats]] chapter.
*Certain Advent stages are now properly distributed, can be unlocked after clearing [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 10|Floor 10]] of the Heavenly Tower.
**[[Clionel Ascendant]] stage is now distributed
**[[River Styx]] stage is now distributed
**[[Queen's Coronation]] stage is now distributed
**[[Dead on Debut]] stage is now distributed
*[[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|SUPERFEST]] is now distributed, now replaces [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)/Switch Version|UBERFEST]].
*The following units became available as a result: [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Hermit Cat]], [[D'artanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'artanyan]], [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Miko Mitama]], [[Shadow Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Shadow Gao]], [[Dark Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Mitama]], and [[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'arktanyan]].</tabber>

